Welcome to Sayanox OS
====================
A Linux-based operating system where the Sayanox programming language
is a first-class citizen.

  Base:   Debian 13 "trixie" minbase (mmdebstrap)
  Arch:   x86_64
  Locale: en_US.UTF-8 (all-English at boot)
  Format: .deb only

Documentation: https://github.com/sayan9168/sayanox-os
Issues:      https://github.com/sayan9168/sayanox-os/issues

Sayanox is not Debian. Debian trademarks are not used.
